\item[S2] M. Bialy, C. Fierobe, A. Glutsyuk, M. Levi, A. Plakhov and S. Tabachnikov, \emph{Open problems on billiards and geometric optics} (2021), arXiv:2110.10750v2, Alexander Plakhov, Problem 3, p. 9. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/2110.10750v2}.
